<h2>Booking Update &mdash; Conflict Resolved</h2>
<p>Dear {{userName}},</p>
<p>Your booking for <strong>{{resourceName}}</strong> has been affected by a schedule conflict.</p>
<table border="1" cellpadding="8" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;">
  <tr><td><strong>Original</strong></td><td>{{originalDate}} {{originalStart}}&ndash;{{originalEnd}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td><strong>New</strong></td><td>{{newDate}} {{newStart}}&ndash;{{newEnd}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td><strong>Location</strong></td><td>{{location}}</td></tr>
</table>
<p>Please log in to the system to review the updated schedule.</p>
